The navigation stack can start over at one screen. Removing a stack from the
phone leaves every screen of it below the one the removal was asked on, and a
stack that is gone cannot be drawn: going back into one would be a screen with
nothing to draw. The package can push, pop and swap the top screen; this lets a
screen replace the whole stack, which is the only way off every screen of a
stack at once.

